Feature: The mountains
  Tall mountains stand round the edge of the field. They are far higher than a drone can fly
  (100 m), so a drone cannot fly over them. The mountains leave the bases, the towers and the
  lake clear. Thus a team cannot send its drones round the outside of the field to the base of
  the enemy. The drones must pass the towers.

  Expectation: Tall mountains stand at the edge of the field
    Then the mountains at the east edge of the field are at least 250 m
    And the mountains at the west edge of the field are at least 250 m

  Expectation: The mountains leave the bases, the towers and the lake clear
    Then the mountains at the bases, the towers and the lake are 0 m

  Expectation: A drone cannot go round the outside of the field
    Then the way round the edge of the field from base to base is closed

  Expectation: A drone that is sent into the mountains flies to the foot of them
    Given the first Blue drone is at the Blue home tower
    When the first Blue drone is sent to a point in the mountains
    Then the point that the first Blue drone flies to is clear of the mountains
